# Pocket Runtime Doctor Assets

## Purpose

The Assets directory contains the visual resources supporting Pocket Runtime Doctor.

These assets document verified product behavior and provide media for engineering documentation, demonstrations, presentations, and future releases.

---

# Contents

This directory may contain:

• Product screenshots

• Avatar artwork

• Runtime diagrams

• User interface graphics

• Demo images

• Icons

• Release artwork

• Packaging artwork

• Promotional media

---

# Engineering Rules

Assets represent verified product functionality.

No placeholder images.

No unverified interfaces.

Visual documentation should match the current verified release.

When product behavior changes, affected assets should be updated as part of the verification process.

---

# Naming Convention

Use descriptive, lowercase filenames.

Examples:

startup.png

patient_scan.png

doctor_report.png

export_complete.png

avatar_idle.png

avatar_scanning.png

---

# Relationship

This directory supports the documentation contained in:

Pocket_Runtime_Doctor/docs/

and the product overview contained in:

Pocket_Runtime_Doctor/README.md

